<!-- SECTION 2: OVERVIEW / INTRO + TL;DR -->
<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Tally Accounting in Mumbai - Overview</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Tally Accounting in Mumbai Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Tally accounting covers end-to-end financial management on <strong>TallyPrime</strong> (2M+ customers): <strong>GST e-invoice</strong> (NIC), <strong>e-way bill</strong>, direct <strong>GSTR-1 upload</strong>, <strong>GSTR-2B reconciliation</strong>, <strong>multi-godown inventory</strong>, <strong>batch/BOM</strong>, <strong>auto BRS</strong>, <strong>payroll</strong> (PF/ESI/PT), <strong>400+ MIS reports</strong>, and <strong>TDL customisation</strong>.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper" style="margin-top:16px;"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Software</td><td>TallyPrime (latest). Desktop + remote via Tally.NET/Gold/AWS cloud.</td></tr><tr><td>Editions</td><td>Silver (single user, Rs 18,000) | Gold (multi-user, Rs 54,000) + TSS annual</td></tr><tr><td>GST Features</td><td>e-Invoice, e-way bill, GSTR-1 direct upload, GSTR-2B recon, ITC monitoring, IMS</td></tr><tr><td>Inventory</td><td>Multi-godown, batch/lot, BOM, stock ageing, reorder, barcode</td></tr><tr><td>Cost From</td><td>Rs 8,000/month (CA-led bookkeeping). Licence separate.</td></tr><tr><td>Authority</td><td>GST Commissionerate Mumbai; Income Tax Dept; RoC Mumbai</td></tr></tbody></table></div></p>
                </div>
                <p>Tally is India's accounting backbone. <strong>TallyPrime</strong> powers the most e-invoices in India. Default software for <strong>Bhuleshwar/Crawford Market</strong> traders, <strong>Andheri MIDC</strong> manufacturers, <strong>Zaveri Bazaar</strong> jewellers. Direct GSTR-1 upload, GSTR-2B reconciliation, multi-godown inventory, 400+ reports. Learn more about <a href="/tally-accounting">Tally Accounting across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Patron's Marine Lines office handles TallyPrime setup, ongoing bookkeeping, and GST filing. Also see <a href="/zoho-books-accounting">Zoho Books Accounting</a> and <a href="/accounting-services/mumbai">Accounting Services in Mumbai</a>.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS GSTAT APPEAL FILING -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">What Is Tally Accounting</h2>
                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p>Maintaining financial records, GST compliance, inventory, and reporting on <strong>TallyPrime</strong> - India's most-installed desktop business software. Handles double-entry accounting, <strong>GST e-invoice + e-way bill</strong>, advanced inventory (<strong>multi-godown, batch, BOM</strong>), <strong>bank reconciliation (auto BRS)</strong>, payroll, and <strong>400+ predefined reports</strong>.</p><p>Trading companies (<strong>Bhuleshwar, Crawford Market, Zaveri Bazaar</strong>): multi-godown inventory across Bhiwandi warehouse + city retail. Manufacturers (<strong>Andheri MIDC, Thane</strong>): BOM for production cost + finished goods valuation. Pharma: batch tracking with expiry. Jewellers: custom gold/diamond inventory. Tally's <strong>keyboard-driven interface</strong> = hundreds of vouchers per hour. <strong>Offline-first</strong> = works during outages. <strong>TSS subscription</strong> = automatic GST updates.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for Tally Accounting in Mumbai:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>TallyPrime:</strong> Successor to Tally.ERP 9. Desktop + remote (Tally.NET/Gold/AWS). Silver (Rs 18K, 1 user) or Gold (Rs 54K, multi-user). TSS for updates.</p><p><strong>Multi-Godown:</strong> Stock across warehouse + showroom + agents. Godown-wise summary. Transfer vouchers. Physical verification. Essential for Mumbai traders.</p><p><strong>BOM:</strong> Bill of Materials for manufacturing. Raw material composition. Auto-compute production cost. Stock journal entry. For MIDC/Thane factories.</p><p><strong>GSTR-2B Recon:</strong> Vendor bills matched against GSTN data. ITC risk monitoring. Mismatch alerts. Monthly reconciliation from Tally.</p><p><strong>400+ Reports:</strong> P&amp;L, BS, cash flow, ratios, item profitability, customer/supplier outstanding, stock summary, fund flow.</p>

