<section class="content-section" id="challenges-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Common Tally Accounting Challenges in Mumbai</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="table-responsive-wrapper">
                <table>
                    <thead><tr><th>Challenge</th><th>Impact</th><th>How Patron Accounting Solves It</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td>Incorrect Ledger Group Configuration</td><td>Wrong placement: direct expense under indirect, current liability as long-term, capex as revenue. Cascades into wrong P&amp;L and BS. Mumbai businesses often use default groups without customisation.</td><td>Patron CA sets up accounting-accurate ledger structure from day one. Every group validated against accounting standards.</td></tr><tr><td>GST Mismatch (Tally vs GSTN)</td><td>e-Invoice amendments not synced. Credit/debit notes entered after filing. HSN mismatches. GSTR-2B reveals ITC discrepancies. Hundreds of monthly invoices need systematic reconciliation.</td><td>Monthly GSTR-2B reconciliation from Tally data. e-Invoice sync verified. HSN codes validated. ITC risk monitored.</td></tr><tr><td>Inventory Valuation Errors</td><td>Multi-godown + batch + different valuation methods (FIFO for one group, WA for another). Inter-godown transfers must be transfer vouchers (not sales). Physical adjustments via stock journals. Wrong valuation = wrong COGS.</td><td>Inventory valuation method documented per stock group. Transfer vouchers enforced. Physical verification facilitated. COGS verified monthly.</td></tr><tr><td>Tally Data Corruption</td><td>Desktop local storage. Hard drive failures, power outages, virus, improper shutdown corrupt .900 files. Without backup = permanent data loss.</td><td>Automated daily backup setup. Tally data recovery support. Cloud backup option configured for critical Mumbai businesses.</td></tr><tr><td>Remote Access and Multi-Branch</td><td>Desktop-first = data locked to local PC. Multi-branch needs Gold + Tally.NET. Remote teams need Tally on Cloud (AWS). Single-user Silver limits collaboration.</td><td>Patron configures Gold + Tally.NET for branches. Tally on Cloud for remote access. Branch consolidation setup. Sync monitoring.</td></tr>

                    </tbody>
                </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

